{
    "map": {
        "bands_for_nodata_value.descr": "<xdoc><p>Specify the NoData value for each band. Each band can have a unique NoData value defined, or you can use the same value for all bands. Choose the band from the drop-down list and then enter a value or multiple values. If you choose multiple NoData values, separate each value with a space.</p><p>If the function chain for each raster within the mosaic dataset contains the Composite Bands function, or if your raster data was added with a raster type that adds the Composite Bands function to each raster&apos;s function chain, then any value you specify will apply to all bands.</p></xdoc>",
        "bands_for_nodata_value.dt.title1": "Band",
        "bands_for_nodata_value.dt.title2": "NoData Value",
        "bands_for_nodata_value.title": "Bands for NoData Value",
        "bands_for_valid_data_range.descr": "Specify a range of values to display for each band. Values outside of this range will be classified as NoData. When working with composite bands, the range will apply to all bands.",
        "bands_for_valid_data_range.dt.title1": "Band",
        "bands_for_valid_data_range.dt.title2": "Minimum Value",
        "bands_for_valid_data_range.dt.title3": "Maximum Value",
        "bands_for_valid_data_range.title": "Bands For Valid Data Range",
        "composite_nodata_value.descr": "<xdoc><p>Choose whether all bands must be NoData in order for the pixel to be classified as NoData.</p><ul><li>Unchecked—If any band has pixels of NoData, then the pixel is classified as NoData. This is the default.</li><li>Checked—All bands must have pixels of NoData for the pixel to be classified as NoData.</li></ul></xdoc>",
        "composite_nodata_value.title": "Composite NoData value from each band",
        "description": "Specifies one or more values to be represented as NoData.",
        "in_mosaic_dataset.descr": "The mosaic dataset where you want to update the NoData values.",
        "in_mosaic_dataset.title": "Mosaic Dataset",
        "num_bands.descr": "The number of bands in the mosaic dataset.",
        "num_bands.title": "Number of Bands",
        "out_mosaic_dataset.title": "Updated Mosaic Dataset",
        "title": "Define Mosaic Dataset NoData",
        "where_clause.descr": "An SQL statement to select specific raster in the mosaic dataset. Only the selected rasters will have their NoData values changed.",
        "where_clause.title": "Query Definition"
    }
}
